22. Academy Continuity Principle

The work completed today establishes a single educational continuity rule:

One learner identity. One Academy relationship. Multiple courses, specialists, and developmental stages.

The learner should be able to move from Preschool to Kinder Garden, Elementary, Middle School, High School, and Higher Learning without repeatedly rebuilding identity or losing continuity.

NAIB helps the learner reach the correct destination.

Khaemenes Academy provides Archaemenes as the institutional academic mentor.

Each course owns its own learning evidence.

Adults verify formal mastery.

Promotion remains deliberate.

Advanced learners may move faster through resources without losing the integrity of formal placement.

